---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="iOS 平台客户端使用指南 · 小火箭 Shadowrocket"
  description="iPhone 与 iPad 平台配置灵动云指南。包含非国区 Apple ID 获取工具说明、Shadowrocket（小火箭）扫码导入订阅、按需连接与策略组配置。"
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: '使用教程', href: '/guides/' }, { label: 'iOS 配置教程' }]} />

      <div class="mt-6">
        <span class="linear-badge">IOS / IPADOS GUIDE</span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          iOS 平台常用客户端使用指南
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          以苹果生态装机普及率最高的 **Shadowrocket（小火箭）** 为例，指导您完成订阅导入、全局路由设置与 VPN 授权。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Steps -->
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
        <div class="linear-card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-900/60 border border-indigo-500/40 text-indigo-300 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
              01
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">下载 Shadowrocket (海外 App Store)</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            由于政策限制，需在 App Store 登录海外（如美区或港区）Apple ID 购买下载 Shadowrocket 或 Loon。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="linear-card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-900/60 border border-purple-500/40 text-purple-300 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
              02
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">添加 Subscribe 订阅类型</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            登录[灵动云控制台](https://varnexa.lingdongaff.com/#/?code=HHoxxHGa)复制订阅链接。打开小火箭，点击右上角「+」，类型选择「Subscribe」，粘贴 URL 并命名为灵动云，点击完成保存。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="linear-card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-900/60 border border-sky-500/40 text-sky-300 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
              03
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">路由模式确认为「配置 (Config)」</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            在首页「全局路由」处确认为「配置」模式，选择心仪的节点。切勿误选为「代理」，配置模式才会智能分流国内直连与外网加速。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="linear-card p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-900/60 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
              04
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">开启连接并授权 iOS VPN</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            打开最上方的未连接开关，系统弹出「“Shadowrocket”想添加 VPN 配置」弹窗，点击「允许」并完成密码验证即可。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-purple-950/20 border border-purple-900/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">阅读 iOS 深度博文</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">《iOS 平台常用客户端与规则配置指南：小火箭 Shadowrocket、Loon 与 Stash》</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/ios-shadowrocket-guide/" class="btn-primary text-xs shrink-0 py-2.5 px-4">
          <span>阅读深度博文</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
